msgid ""
"**Note: Geometry optimizations using the LT methods are no longer supported."
" Analytical energy gradients are disabled unless the Molpro variable "
"``ENABLE_LTGRAD=1`` is set before FORCES or OPTG.**"
msgstr ""
"**注意：不再支持使用 LT 方法进行几何优化。除非在 FORCES 或 OPTG 之前设置了 Molpro 变量 "
"``ENABLE_LTGRAD=1``，否则解析能量梯度将被禁用。**"

msgid "``EOM,-n.1, key1=value1, key2=value2,…``"
msgstr "``EOM,-n.1, key1=value1, key2=value2,…``"

msgid ""
"**``SINGLET``\\ =\\ *ising*** If set to 1, singlet states will be calculated"
" (default)."
msgstr "**``SINGLET``\\ =\\ *\\ ising*** 若设为 1，则计算单重态（默认）。"

msgid ""
"**``TRIPLET``\\ =\\ *itrip*** If set to 1, triplet states will be calculated"
" (not implemented for ADC(2))."
msgstr "**``TRIPLET``\\ =\\ *\\ itrip*** 若设为 1，则计算三重态（ADC(2) 未实现）。"

msgid ""
"**``EXFILE``\\ =\\ *record.ifil*** Record for converged CIS eigenvectors "
"(default 6100.2)."
msgstr "**``EXFILE``\\ =\\ *\\ record.ifil*** 收敛的 CIS 本征矢量的记录（默认 6100.2）。"

msgid "**``SAVE``\\ =\\ *record.ifil*** Record for save of restart information."
msgstr "**``SAVE``\\ =\\ *\\ record.ifil*** 用于保存重启信息的记录。"

msgid ""
"**``SAVET``\\ =\\ *record.ifil*** Record for restart information for triplet"
" states (if calculated together with singlet states)."
msgstr "**``SAVET``\\ =\\ *\\ record.ifil*** 用于三重态重启信息的记录（若与单重态一起计算）。"

msgid ""
"**``START``\\ =\\ *record.ifil*** Record for restart of previous "
"calculation."
msgstr "**``START``\\ =\\ *\\ record.ifil*** 用于从先前计算重启的记录。"

msgid ""
"**``STARTT``\\ =\\ *record.ifil*** Record for restart of previous "
"calculation (if calculated together with singlet states)."
msgstr "**``STARTT``\\ =\\ *\\ record.ifil*** 用于从先前计算重启的记录（若与单重态一起计算）。"

msgid ""
"**``NSRCH4ST``\\ =\\ *nst*** In the first *nst* iterations in the Davidson "
"diagonalisation the excited state domains are determined for each basis "
"vector in the Davidson subspace (\"search for states\") (default 7)."
msgstr ""
"**``NSRCH4ST``\\ =\\ *\\ nst*** 在 Davidson 对角化的前 *\\ nst* 次迭代中，为 Davidson "
"子空间中的每个基向量确定激发态轨道域（“搜索态”）（默认 7）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRLCH``\\ =\\ *thrlch*** threshold for the Davidson procedure. If "
"smaller than zero, the Davidson procedure is skipped and DIIS is started "
"directly instead (possible only for restart, ``SAVE`` and ``START`` have to "
"be identical)."
msgstr ""
"**``THRLCH``\\ =\\ *\\ thrlch*** Davidson 过程的阈值。若小于零，则跳过 Davidson 过程而直接启动 "
"DIIS（仅可能在重启时使用，\\ ``SAVE`` 与 ``START`` 必须相同）。"

msgid "**``THRLCD``\\ =\\ *thrlcd*** threshold for DIIS."
msgstr "**``THRLCD``\\ =\\ *\\ thrlcd*** DIIS 的阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``ADC2``\\ =\\ *adc2*** if :math:`=1`, do ADC(2) calculation instead of "
"CC2."
msgstr "**``ADC2``\\ =\\ *\\ adc2*** 若 :math:`=1`\\ ，则进行 ADC(2) 计算而非 CC2。"

msgid ""
"**``LTGS``\\ =\\ *ltgs*** if :math:`=1`, use LT-DF-LMP2 for the ground "
"state."
msgstr "**``LTGS``\\ =\\ *\\ ltgs*** 若 :math:`=1`\\ ，则对基态使用 LT-DF-LMP2。"

msgid ""
"**``INTFRAC``\\ =\\ *fracint*** Rough criterion for specifying eom-domains "
"from laplace-transformed integrals (default 0.8)."
msgstr "**``INTFRAC``\\ =\\ *\\ fracint*** 根据 Laplace 变换积分指定 eom 域的粗略判据（默认 0.8）。"

msgid ""
"**``INTEXC``\\ =\\ *excint*** Criterion for specifying important orbitals "
"from laplace-transformed integrals (default 0.999)."
msgstr "**``INTEXC``\\ =\\ *\\ excint*** 根据 Laplace 变换积分指定重要轨道的判据（默认 0.999）。"

msgid ""
"**``REALFRAC``\\ =\\ *fracreal*** Exact criterion for specifying eom-domains"
" from laplace-transformed integrals (default 0.98)."
msgstr "**``REALFRAC``\\ =\\ *\\ fracreal*** 根据 Laplace 变换积分指定 eom 域的精确判据（默认 0.98）。"

msgid ""
"**``FULLFRAC``\\ =\\ *fracfull*** Check for all orbital domains (complete "
"sum over all orbitals) (default 0.95)."
msgstr "**``FULLFRAC``\\ =\\ *\\ fracfull*** 对所有轨道域进行检查（对所有轨道完整求和）（默认 0.95）。"

msgid ""
"To switch to local approximations calculated according to Ref. [9] "
"(Boughton-Pulay procedure for excited states), set ``INTFRAC`` to zero."
msgstr "要切换到按照文献 [9] 计算的局域近似（用于激发态的 Boughton-Pulay 过程），请将 ``INTFRAC`` 设为零。"

msgid ""
"**``EWEAKPAIR``\\ =\\ *ewpair*** Distance criterion for excited state "
"orbital pairs definition (default 5)."
msgstr "**``EWEAKPAIR``\\ =\\ *\\ ewpair*** 激发态轨道对定义的距离判据（默认 5）。"

msgid ""
"**``ALLSTRONG``\\ =\\ *allstr*** Different possibilities for excited state "
"orbital pairs:"
msgstr "**``ALLSTRONG``\\ =\\ *\\ allstr*** 激发态轨道对的不同可能性："

msgid ""
"0: :math:`[ij]\\leq` *ewpair*, :math:`[im]\\leq` *ewpair*, :math:`[mn]\\leq`"
" *ewpair*; 1: :math:`\\forall [ij]`, :math:`\\forall [im]`, "
":math:`[mn]\\leq` *ewpair*; 2: :math:`\\forall [ij]`, :math:`[im]\\leq` "
"*ewpair*, :math:`[mn]\\leq` *ewpair* (default); where :math:`i`, :math:`j` "
"are important orbitals and :math:`m`, :math:`n` non-important. More detailed"
" see Ref. [1]."
msgstr ""
"0：\\ :math:`[ij]\\leq` *ewpair*\\ ，\\ :math:`[im]\\leq` *ewpair*\\ ，\\ "
":math:`[mn]\\leq` *ewpair*\\ ；1：\\ :math:`\\forall [ij]`\\ ，\\ "
":math:`\\forall [im]`\\ ，\\ :math:`[mn]\\leq` *ewpair*\\ ；2：\\ "
":math:`\\forall [ij]`\\ ，\\ :math:`[im]\\leq` *ewpair*\\ ，\\ "
":math:`[mn]\\leq` *ewpair*\\ （默认）；其中 :math:`i`\\ 、\\ :math:`j` 为重要轨道，\\ "
":math:`m`\\ 、\\ :math:`n` 为非重要轨道。详见文献 [1]。"

msgid ""
"**``PRECOND``\\ =\\ *prec*** Type of preconditioner in LT-DF-LCC2/ADC(2) and"
" DF-CIS:"
msgstr "**``PRECOND``\\ =\\ *\\ prec*** LT-DF-LCC2/ADC(2) 与 DF-CIS 中预条件器的类型："

msgid ""
"0: canonical orbital energies; 3: solving linear equations including "
"diagonal part of :math:`(H-F)^{\\rm CIS}` with MINRES (default)."
msgstr "0：正则轨道能量；3：使用 MINRES 求解包含 :math:`(H-F)^{\\rm CIS}` 对角部分的线性方程（默认）。"

msgid ""
"**``HSCAL``\\ =\\ *hscl*** Scaling factor for diagonal part of "
":math:`(H-F)^{\\rm CIS}` matrix in the case of linear equations "
"preconditioner (default 0.7)."
msgstr ""
"**``HSCAL``\\ =\\ *\\ hscl*** 在线性方程预条件器情形下 :math:`(H-F)^{\\rm CIS}` "
"矩阵对角部分的标度因子（默认 0.7）。"

msgid ""
"**``PROPES``\\ =\\ *prop*** States for which properties (dipole moments) "
"should be calculated,"
msgstr "**``PROPES``\\ =\\ *\\ prop*** 应计算性质（偶极矩）的态，"

msgid ""
"``e.g., PROPES=-3.1+5.1-8.1+15.1 $\\Longrightarrow$ 2.1 3.1 5.1 6.1 7.1 8.1 "
"15.1``"
msgstr ""
"``例如，PROPES=-3.1+5.1-8.1+15.1 $\\Longrightarrow$ 2.1 3.1 5.1 6.1 7.1 8.1 "
"15.1``"

msgid ""
"**``TRANES``\\ =\\ *tran*** States for which transition moments should be "
"calculated, syntax like for properties."
msgstr "**``TRANES``\\ =\\ *\\ tran*** 应计算跃迁矩的态，语法与性质相同。"

msgid ""
"**``DENSAVE``\\ =\\ *rec.ifil*** Record, where densities calculated for "
"states *prop* can be saved (for printing, see `print options "
"<local_methods_for_excited_states.html#print-options>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**``DENSAVE``\\ =\\ *\\ rec.ifil*** 记录，用于保存为态 *\\ prop* 计算的密度（打印见 `print "
"options <local_methods_for_excited_states.html#print-options>`__\\ ）"

msgid "**``GSONLY``\\ =0 or 1** 1: only ground state gradient is calculated"
msgstr "**``GSONLY``\\ =0 或 1** 1：仅计算基态梯度"

msgid ""
"**``GRADSTATE``\\ =\\ *gradstate*** Excited state for which the gradient is "
"to be calculated, e.g., ``GRADSTATE=2.1``; must be combined with "
"``GSONLY=0``"
msgstr ""
"**``GRADSTATE``\\ =\\ *\\ gradstate*** 要计算梯度的激发态，例如 ``GRADSTATE=2.1``\\ ；必须与"
" ``GSONLY=0`` 组合使用"

msgid ""
"**``GRADDIIS``\\ =0 or 1** 0: DIIS after Davidson diagonalization is "
"switched off for all states except *gradstate*"
msgstr "**``GRADDIIS``\\ =0 或 1** 0：除 *gradstate* 外的所有态在 Davidson 对角化后关闭 DIIS"

msgid ""
"**``NOFOLLOWGRAD``\\ =0 or 1** 0: tries to follow a state in a geometry "
"optimization after crossing on the basis of the overlap with eigenvector of "
"previous geometry; 1: calculate gradient of state number *gradstate* "
"regardless of crossing"
msgstr ""
"**``NOFOLLOWGRAD``\\ =0 或 1** "
"0：几何优化中交叉后，基于与前一几何构型本征矢量的重叠尝试跟随某个态；1：无论是否交叉，均计算态编号 *gradstate* 的梯度"

msgid ""
"**``ONLYTOTZLM``\\ =0 or 1** 1: only total, rather than ground- and excited "
"state Lagrange multipliers for orbital variations are computed. Hence, only "
"one set of CPL and CPHF equations need to be solved rather than two. "
"However, orbital relaxed properties are then not available."
msgstr ""
"**``ONLYTOTZLM``\\ =0 或 1** 1：仅计算轨道变化的总拉格朗日乘子，而非基态和激发态的拉格朗日乘子。因此，只需解一套 CPL 和"
" CPHF 方程而非两套。然而，此时无法获得轨道弛豫性质。"

msgid ""
"``NPOINTS\\_CC2S`` Number of quadrature points in CC2 in \"search for "
"states\" (default 1)."
msgstr "``NPOINTS\\_CC2S`` CC2 中“搜索态”的求积点数目（默认 1）。"

msgid ""
"``DISTRF`` Type of distribution function in functional for determination of "
"Laplace points:"
msgstr "``DISTRF`` 泛函中用于确定 Laplace 点的分布函数类型："

msgid "0: integral with f_x=1; 4: sum of distributions f_x (default)."
msgstr "0：f_x=1 的积分；4：分布 f_x 之和（默认）。"

msgid "``For EOMPRINT card:``"
msgstr "``For EOMPRINT card:``"

msgid ""
"The densities saved with ``DENSAVE`` can be written into a cube file. "
"Corresponding commands in the :doc:`CUBE module "
"<dump_density_or_orbital_values_cube>` are"
msgstr ""
"用 ``DENSAVE`` 保存的密度可以写入 cube 文件。\\ :doc:`CUBE 模块 "
"<dump_density_or_orbital_values_cube>` 中相应的命令为"

msgid ""
"**``DENSITY``,\\ *rec.ifil*,\\ ``cc2``** Creates a cube file from the ground"
" state density saved on record *rec.ifil*."
msgstr ""
"**``DENSITY``,\\ *\\ rec.ifil\\ *,\\ ``cc2``** 从记录 *\\ rec.ifil* 上保存的基态密度创建 "
"cube 文件。"

msgid ""
"**``DENSITY``,\\ *rec.ifil*,\\ ``full,state``\\ =\\ *st.1*** Creates a cube "
"file from the excited state density of state *st.1*."
msgstr ""
"**``DENSITY``,\\ *\\ rec.ifil\\ *,\\ ``full,state``\\ =\\ *\\ st.1*** 从态 *\\"
" st.1* 的激发态密度创建 cube 文件。"

msgid ""
"**``DENSITY``,\\ *rec.ifil*,\\ ``diff,state``\\ =\\ *st.1*** Creates a cube "
"file from the difference density (``full`` - ``cc2``) for state *st.1*."
msgstr ""
"**``DENSITY``,\\ *\\ rec.ifil\\ *,\\ ``diff,state``\\ =\\ *\\ st.1*** 从态 *\\"
" st.1* 的差分密度（\\ ``full`` - ``cc2``\\ ）创建 cube 文件。"

msgid ""
"In order to set up an input for a geometry optimization of an excited state "
"we recommend to use the input examples `furan_opt_ltdflcc2lr.inp "
"<media/examples/furan_opt_ltdflcc2lr.inp>`__ (for local CC2) and "
"`furan_opt_ltdflucc2lr.inp <media/examples/furan_opt_ltdflucc2lr.inp>`__ "
"(for local ADC(2) aka TD-LUCC[2]-H) as templates. Provided that second-order"
" methods like CC2 or ADC(2) are appropriate for the state to be optimized, "
"it is recommended to use local ADC(2) rather than local CC2, since the "
"former is considerably faster. Even if a local CC2 optimized geometry of an "
"excited state is required, it is wise to preoptimize with local ADC(2). For "
"a comparison of the performance of these two methods in geometry "
"optimizations we refer to Ref. [8]."
msgstr ""
"为了设置激发态几何优化的输入，我们建议使用输入示例 `furan_opt_ltdflcc2lr.inp "
"<media/examples/furan_opt_ltdflcc2lr.inp>`__\\ （用于局域 CC2）和 "
"`furan_opt_ltdflucc2lr.inp <media/examples/furan_opt_ltdflucc2lr.inp>`__\\ "
"（用于局域 ADC(2)，又称 TD-LUCC[2]-H）作为模板。假若 CC2 或 ADC(2) 等二阶方法适合待优化的态，建议使用局域 ADC(2)"
" 而非局域 CC2，因为前者明显更快。即使需要激发态的局域 CC2 优化几何构型，明智的做法也是先用局域 ADC(2) "
"进行预优化。关于这两种方法在几何优化中的性能比较，请参阅文献 [8]。"
